  "solution": {
    "text": "Given equation of lines are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><p>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Eliminating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>32</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, which is a&nbsp;hyperbola.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+<